WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.040
What happens when you place&nbsp;
pennies into the Clockworks?

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:08.320
Assistant Researcher Kendrick placed twenty&nbsp;
cents in pennies into SCP-914 on the setting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.560
"Fine." The output produced was a sculpture&nbsp;
of former US President Abraham Lincoln.

